    {
      "target": "Data/Festivals/spring24",
      "key": "Clint_y2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "*sigh* Everyone is partnered up... and here I am alone, once again...$2#$e#Ah well... I'll just drown my sorrows with some of that sweet and tangy jelly.",
      "translation": "*povzdech* Všichni mají partnera... a já jsem tu zase sám...$2#$e#No nic... Utopím žal v troše toho sladkokyselého želé.",
      "sourceSHA256": "aaa70621a5f61e2e492f0f9de59b171e92935151a2e4f217426d4683bf99b0ce",
      "translationSHA256": "7220fc05248421e3bf1fbffd69d2fb046bab88d3d5436e1666b5ac05383c94b5",
